Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 07:22:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] windowing/gbm: tell that another monitor is used when Kodi is
 started again

On GBM the output is chosen when Kodi starts. Choosing another monitor
in the settings did nothing that could be seen: the setting was saved
and the display stayed the same until the next start, with only the
help text of the setting to say that the change "may require restart".

A notification now says so when an output other than the one in use is
chosen. Nothing is told when the output that is named is the one in
use, nor before the skin is loaded (the setting is also written when
Kodi starts).
